<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT PHOENIX OPEN AFTER FINAL ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT PHOENIX OPEN AFTER FINAL ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores from the</p>
<p>$1.5 million Phoenix Open after the final round on the</p>
<p>6,992-yard, par-71 TPC of Scottsdale on Sunday (players U.S.</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
